      "description": "Fila con icono, etiqueta y contador semántico.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-filter\" aria-pressed=\"true\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"9\"/><path d=\"M12 7v5l4 2\"/></svg><span>Pendientes</span><b>3</b></button>",
      "css": ".ds-filter{display:grid;grid-template-columns:25px minmax(0,1fr) auto;align-items:center;gap:12px;width:100%;min-height:44px;padding:6px 12px;border:1px solid currentColor;border-left-color:var(--paper,#c7c2ff);border-radius:7px;background:var(--sunk,#2d3038);color:var(--fg,#f4f2ed);font-family:var(--f-body,\"Geist\",\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif);font-size:.82rem;text-align:left;font-weight:400;cursor:pointer}.ds-filter svg{width:20px;height:20px;color:var(--st-prep,#efca88)}.ds-filter b{font-size:.75rem;font-weight:500;min-width:30px;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:14px;text-align:center;background:var(--st-prep-bg,#343028);color:var(--st-prep,#efca88)}.ds-filter:hover{background:var(--sunk,#2d3038)}.ds-filter:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--petal,#d8d3ff);outline-offset:3px}"
